author=fiio-m11
description=Replaces the system CA store with AOSP's current system/ca-certificates (149 roots): adds ISRG Root X1/X2, GTS, Amazon, Microsoft 2017 and others; drops expired and distrusted roots (WoSign, StartCom, CNNIC, Certinomis, Symantec).
